{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act36side_level_act36side_02_beg",
  "groupId": "act36side",
  "stageId": "act36side_02",
  "title": "雨林解毒炖汤",
  "storyCode": "DT-2",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act36side/level_act36side_02_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "6c97ae536eb866f2a7b1f5f9d64c0d10a6b7da94fd8bd9ca2e76436a0f41bf2e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "莱欧斯，快跟上啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "快来看这颗蘑菇！迷宫里最大的走路菇都没有这么大吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "要是走路菇长得这么大该有多威风啊......一会儿的午饭可以考虑吃它吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "你小心一点啊，美食指南里说丛林里面的蘑菇多多少少都有一些毒性。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "比如吃了之后会全身起疹子，会导致血液凝固，会不断呕吐直到把内脏都吐出来之类的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "......不敢想象写下这本指南的人都经历了什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "老夫只跟着兽人学了分辨迷宫蘑菇的方法，这些没见过的还是不要轻易尝试了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "可这边有动物把这种厚厚的蘑菇当作食物！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "不行，如果只有一两种动物在吃，那么这种植物对大部分动物可能都有毒性。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "换句话说，如果很多动物都在吃，那么它才有可能是没有毒性的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "（低沉的咆哮）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "什么声音？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "（尖锐的蜂鸣）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "有什么东西往这边飞来了！大家小心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯小队",
      "text": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "（东敲敲，西敲敲）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "嚯！刚才那一发炸得真够狠的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "幸好找了没人的测试场地。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "我看看......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "膛压，爆表。温度，爆表。装载量，也爆表！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "看来还是要劲够大才好使。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "接下来就是最后调试一下刚才的配置，松松皮带，紧紧螺丝就完成了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "只要不出什么意外，我的最新力作“无敌的酷东西”就可以开出去了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "啊，得赶紧先把易爆品都拆掉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "远离明火，安全第一~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "text": "（东敲敲，西敲敲）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "咳咳......那边有东西一直在爆炸......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "咳咳......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "玛露西尔，你没事吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "我、我还好！只是，有点头晕......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "（低沉的咆哮）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "怎么还有......！小心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "是魔像吗？还是石像鬼？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "看我用魔法——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "轰隆——！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "大祭司，大祭司，你在这里吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......什么声音？\n——呜哇！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "鳄鱼！还是长着鳄鱼头的兽人？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鳄鱼头兽人",
      "text": "啊？兽人是什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "还说话了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鳄鱼头兽人",
      "text": "我会说话很奇怪吗？——喂，那边那两个杜林，你们是从地下刚爬上来的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "“杜林”？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "喊我们吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鳄鱼头兽人",
      "text": "除了你们两个矮个子还有谁长得像杜林？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "也就是说，在他眼里，我和齐尔查克是同一个种族？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "这里没有“半身人”这样的说法吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鳄鱼头兽人",
      "text": "......什么乱七八糟的，你们这群人指定是有点毛病。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鳄鱼头兽人",
      "text": "对了，你们有没有在这里见过我们的大祭司？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "大祭司？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鳄鱼头兽人",
      "text": "一个老头，比我矮点，戴个眼镜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "他为什么会出现在这么危险的地方？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鳄鱼头兽人",
      "text": "大祭司的想法一向很神秘。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "但我们一路过来，没见过这样的老者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鳄鱼头兽人",
      "text": "大祭司的行踪确实也很神秘。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鳄鱼头兽人",
      "text": "既然这样，我还是回部落里去好了，反正每次出来找他都是这样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鳄鱼头兽人",
      "text": "再见，奇怪的游客！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "等等！请问，你听说过罗德岛吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鳄鱼头兽人",
      "text": "啧啧，你们算是走运又有点不走运。因为我好像听过，又好像没听过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鳄鱼头兽人",
      "text": "但我肯定，部落里有人知道这个什么岛在哪里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鳄鱼头兽人",
      "text": "但是这个人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "不会就是大祭司吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鳄鱼头兽人",
      "text": "你猜对了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鳄鱼头兽人",
      "text": "这样吧，你们和我回部落里，一般我们出去找大祭司，总会找不到，但大祭司过一会自己也就回来了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聪明的鳄鱼头兽人",
      "text": "也就是说，你们之前在一座岛上，上面有个大迷宫，你们走着走着就到这里来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "差不多就是这样，您知道些什么吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聪明的鳄鱼头兽人",
      "text": "嗯......岛是什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "啊？就是......海上的陆地。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聪明的鳄鱼头兽人",
      "text": "海是什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "呃......就是有很多水的地方？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聪明的鳄鱼头兽人",
      "text": "那不是湖吗？你说话还挺怪的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "唔，因为这里是内陆吗......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聪明的鳄鱼头兽人",
      "text": "是你的问题太奇怪了！我从没听过什么海啊，岛啊，叫梅里尼的村子啊，你们该不会是被人一尾巴从泰拉的另一边扫过来的吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "泰拉......是什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聪明的鳄鱼头兽人",
      "text": "就是这里啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "玛露西尔试图从眼前的鳄鱼人的眼神中找到他在耍自己的痕迹。\n可惜，在那直率的眼神中，只有“这人该不会是个傻子吧？”这样一个信息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "总之就是，这群鳄......阿达克利斯里说得上话的是大祭司，玛露西尔刚刚炸坏的魔像就是他的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯A",
      "text": "机甲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯B",
      "text": "“无敌的酷东西”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "我们弄坏了他的“机甲”，他会愿意帮我们找罗德岛吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯A",
      "text": "没有关系，就算没有你们，那台机甲终究也会爆炸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯B",
      "text": "就没有不爆炸的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聪明的阿达克利斯",
      "text": "大祭司很随和的，只要等他回来跟他说明情况，想必他不会怪罪你们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聪明的阿达克利斯",
      "text": "大祭司也很仗义，看到你们在这里迷路，他绝对不会见死不救。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聪明的阿达克利斯",
      "text": "这就是我们的大祭司！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "虽是这么说，但我们也要想个办法赔礼道歉才好......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聪明的阿达克利斯",
      "text": "不用在意啦——什么味道这么香，今天轮到谁做饭来着？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯战士",
      "text": "是那个大胡子杜林在做饭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "泰拉、阿卡胡拉、活画、迷宫......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "呜......不行，完全理不出头绪......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "魔法在这里也可以使用，这就说明在法则上是有共通之处的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "法琳，要是你还在的话，我一定会像莱欧斯那样，对正在发生的这一切兴致勃勃吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "唉，真想念我们一起在学校学习的日子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "那时候......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "咦，这些小鸟吃的这个果子......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "和那时候法琳给我吃的果子好像......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯A",
      "text": "好香啊，杜林做饭的手艺也这么好？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "老夫不是杜林......唉，就当老夫是杜林吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯A",
      "text": "快叫兄弟们都来尝尝大胡子杜林的手艺！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯B",
      "text": "对了，你们刚才说要去找大祭司？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "嗯，我们想要向他请教一些问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯A",
      "text": "也对，大祭司是这里最聪明的人，但要见他没那么容易。要是他想见你们，你们就能见到他；要是他不愿意，你们是一定见不到他的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "这倒是很符合智者的做派......那怎么样才能让他想见我们呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯B",
      "text": "嗯......祖玛玛大姐吩咐过，要是我们想借用大祭司的智慧，就得搞出点热闹的动静！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森西",
      "text": "热闹的动静......一顿大餐算吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿达克利斯B",
      "text": "差不多吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "我没意见，问问玛露西尔的想法吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱欧斯",
      "text": "这么说起来，玛露西尔呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "齐尔查克",
      "text": "她还没回来吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "玛露西尔",
      "text": "可恶的炎龙，把法琳还给我！！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
